  "content_en": "Chapter 1: Is the \"she\" mentioned in the inkstone of the first marriage to the royal family the princess? If so, why didn't you say more? And where is the third lady who has not been seen? Luo Xue had a series of questions in her heart. Thinking about it, there were really too many things in this palace that she couldn't figure out. On the night of the worship service, the sad looks of the five ladies were still imprinted in Luo Xue's mind, but just now Yan Shu showed himself the Shou Gong Sha on her arm, something that should have been hidden, but easily told him, what on earth did she want to tell herself? She wants to say that she loves the prince too, but the prince doesn't love her and even refuses to touch her? No, that's not the case, she probably doesn't love, but what exactly does she want to express? Luo Xue couldn't understand. She just felt that Yan Shu had no ill intentions towards her, and she was friendly. It was already noon when she left Songmeixuan of Yanshu. Luo Xue was not feeling hungry at all, so she dismissed the bearers and walked with Xiao happy. Fortunately, except for special reasons, there are basically no opportunities to have dinner together in the palace. The palace was so big, Luo Xue was sure that she had not taken the wrong path, but when she walked back to the small building, the sun had already set in the west. \"Who are you?\" Luo Xue returned to the small house in the middle of the lake and suddenly saw a maid at the door. The maid leaned over and bowed, saying: \"This slave is dressed in clothes. It was the prince who asked the slave to come and serve his wife.\" \"Oh, it's enough for me to have Xiaoxi here. You'd better go back.\" Luo Xue said lazily. Xi Yi knelt on the ground with a plop, \"Madam, don't you want Xi Yi?\" \"What are you doing?\" \"Please Madam, keep Xi Yi, otherwise Xi Yi will be a death penalty.\" Xi Yi buried his head, and his words were strong, but there was an element of prayer in them. \"Death penalty? Who wants you to die?\" Luo Xue was puzzled. \"Death penalty\" was too far away from her. \"I don't dare to say this. Please keep my clothes, Madam.\" How could a servant say this? \"Well, just stay. I'm a little tired.\" Luo Xue was really tired, \"Get up.\" \"Thank you, madam,\" Xi Yi stood up and said sweetly, \"Xi Yi is waiting for the princess to undress.\" \"No need. Are you really sent here by the prince?\" Luo Xue was still doubtful about the sudden addition of a maid. \"Yes.\" \"Then what else did the prince say?\" \"The prince said that there was a strong wind at night and asked his wife to take care of her health. The prince also said that he would not be able to come today.\" \"Oh, then you and Xiao Xi can go down together.\" After that, Luo Xue walked into the room, simply took off her makeup, and fell on the soft couch. The softness and comfort of the surroundings made it easy for people to relax. At the same time, it touched a place in Luo Xue's heart that she dared not touch. It replayed in Luo Xue's dream like a nightmare, as if she had returned to the past. She dreamed that she was still a little girl with her mother protecting her. Five years ago, thirteen-year-old Luo Xue was in the room with her mother, just accompanying her, quietly, without speaking. The noisy sounds of guests coming from outside could not change the quiet atmosphere in the room. She knew that on such a night, her father, who she had always regarded as a god, was getting married. For a person who was defined as a sun chaser by the tribe, getting married was such a big event, and it was natural for it to be lively. On such a night, the joy outside did not belong to her, nor to her mother. She knew that her mother needed her company. After a long time, her mother spoke: \"Xue'er, go out and get something to eat.\" \"Mom, I'm not hungry, I want to stay with you.\" Her mother walked from the bedside to the window, facing the moonlight, and smiled, \"This night is so beautiful. Xue'er, do you want to see moonlight butterflies?\" The young Luo Xue nodded. She saw her mother go to the dressing table and take out something from the small drawer, and the fragrance suddenly filled the whole room. \"Mom, what is this? It smells so good.\" She spread her hands, and three small scarlet pills lay quietly on the palm of her mother's hand. \"This is called Midie Fragrance. Now, Mom is leaving one pill and giving you two. Remember to give one to your sister. Tell her to hold it in your mouth when you feel desperate, and the Moonlight Butterfly will fly over with hope.\" \"Really?\" Luo Xue took the two small pills in her hand, put them in front of her nose and smelled them, and a refreshing feeling of relief came to her heart. \"Beautiful flowers are blooming all over spring, and they are no match for the sweet fragrance of butterflies. The butterflies are so greedy that they forget their way home, and the beautiful lady smiles in her sleep.\" \"Mother, what are you talking about? Look, there are really butterflies.\" On the darker trees outside the window, there were a few butterflies dancing with a faint glow, attracting Luo Xue's attention. \"Xue'er, mother is tired and has gone to bed. Just watch the butterflies obediently.\" After saying that, he saidHe closed his eyes calmly. Little Luo Xue didn't know what despair was, nor did she know that that was where her mother spoke for the last time. If she knew, she would definitely not look at the luminous butterfly outside the window. The next morning, she touched her mother's already cold cheek and knew that her mother would never come back. The aunt who served her mother told her that the women of the non-Luo tribe were as strong as her mother. When she fell in love with someone, she would not allow any impurities. Marriage by the patriarch was tantamount to betrayal, so her mother chose to die. A kind of hatred filled Luo Xue's mind. She knew that it was her father's newly married woman who killed her mother. She hid the knife behind her, walked to the new house, knocked on the door, and shouted: \"Auntie, are you up?\" \"Who is it?\" The door opened, and a beautiful face appeared in front of Luo Xue. She smiled like a flower. \"Auntie, happy wedding. I have a gift for you.\" He said, motioning for her to bend down. The woman obeyed obediently. She didn't know what kind of gift the well-behaved little girl in front of her would give her. \"Haha.\" Luo Xue also smiled, with the same charming look, but a little more enchanting. She flashed the knife hidden behind her and slashed at the woman in front of her, steadily, accurately and ruthlessly. Every time the knife was struck, a red flower immediately bloomed on her fair face. \"Ah!\" The biting pain came. The woman covered her injured face, backed away, stumbled and fell to the ground, and fainted. Luo Xue walked over and looked at her contemptuously, \"Sacrifice my mother with your face. It is said that it is easier for you.\" Looking around, there was no sign of her father, and she breathed a sigh of relief. A smiling clay doll on the table came into her sight. She walked over quickly and fell to the ground angrily, shattering into pieces in an instant. The pleasure of revenge made her feel extremely happy. \"What are you doing?\" Auntie's trembling voice reached her ears. \"Sister, what are you doing?\" My sister Luo Shang was also asking. \"I ruined her appearance!\" Luo Xue said firmly. \"When the patriarch finds out, he will kill you.\" My aunt couldn't believe it. \"Aunt, will dad really kill me?\" Luo Xue knelt down, she was scared. \"Auntie, you have to save me.\" The kind-hearted aunt cherished Luo Xue. Her eyes filled with tears when she thought that the sisters had lost their mother when they were only teenagers. She pulled up Luo Xue and said, \"Let's go, aunt will take you to the mountains to hide.\" Yunnan has many mountains and water, and it is not difficult to hide three people in the dense woods. After hiding in the mountains for more than ten days, Luo Xue looked at her somewhat frail sister and felt filled with guilt. Her sister was not in good health, but she had to hide with him in the mountains. What if she got sick? So I begged my aunt to go down the mountain. I should bear the consequences of the wrong things I did. I couldn't let my sister suffer with me. After Luo Xue went down the mountain, it was already night when she returned to the village, only to see the village full of fire, blazing fire, billowing smoke, and scorching air rushing towards her. The village is on fire? An ominous premonition floated in Luo Xue's heart. \"Dad, where are you?\" Without thinking much, Luo Xue rushed into the burning house. There was no response in the smoke-filled house, \"Dad, where are you? Can you answer Xue'er?\" After a while, there was still no response. She squatted down, completely forgetting that she was in the fire, and did not pay attention to the roof ridge that was about to fall. \"Be careful!\" The aunt pulled her out of the fire, but the edge of the roof inevitably hit Luo Xue on the forehead. \"Does it hurt?\" He looked at Luo Xue with pity, worried in his heart, what would happen if there were scars on his perfect face? Luo Xue shook her head and asked belatedly: \"Aunt, why didn't dad answer me? Is he angry with me?\" \"Xue'er, don't think about it, the patriarch loves you, he...\" Before she could finish her words, she heard a man's voice: \"So you two cheap girls are here.\" Luo Xue recognized the speaker. He came to the village half a year ago. He was a doctor and a piano player. His real name was Tianzhi. \"Is that you?\" my aunt asked doubtfully. \"It's me. I've come to you for a lot of hardships.\" He walked up to Luo Shang, raised her chin with his hand, and said, \"I'm afraid that little girl has suffered a lot, right? But your father is gone. Barbarians are barbarians, and they can destroy a village very quickly.\" \"You killed my father?\" Luo Xue almost shouted. \"Yes!\" A strange smile appeared on Tianzhi's face. \"What's so rare about asking a barbarian army to eradicate a village?\" \"You... let go of my sister!\" \"Let go?\" Tianzhi smiled even brighter, \"ah! He cried out in pain, \"You bitch, you dare to bite me!\" \"After that, he shook the weak Luo Shang away with all his strength. Luo Shang wiped the bright red blood on his mouth with his hand and said bitterly: \"You deserve it! \"What a pair of cheap girls!\" Tianzhi took a breath and shouted loudly into the distance: \"General, there are still people alive here!\" \"As soon as the sound came out, the soldiers not far away heard it and strode towards here. Seeing this, my aunt hurriedly grabbed Tianzhi's leg and shouted: \"Xue'er, take your sister away quickly! Luo Xue pulled Luo Shang up obediently, \"Auntie, what about you?\" \"Leave me alone, run!\" \"Aunt, aunt!\" \"Luo Xue woke up from her sleep in shock, only to find sweat on her forehead. \"Madam, what's wrong? \"Hearing the sound, he broke into the house wearing clothes. \"It's nothing, I had a nightmare. Luo Xue wiped the sweat from her forehead, but heard the sound of the bronze mirror falling to the ground, \"Who?\" Who is there! \"Before he could say anything else, a cold sword was placed on his neck, but the hand holding the sword was trembling. \"Madam! \"Xi Yi became alert. \"Bold! \"\"stand up! \"The assassin put his sword against Luo Xue to let her get up. \"Let go, madam! \"Xi Yi said firmly. The cold voice had no effect at all. The assassin threw something at her: \"Go away! \"There was no other way. Xi Yi had to step aside and watched the assassin holding Luo Xue walking toward her step by step. She thought about when she should take action. She had to decide quickly. If she walked out of the door, she might not have a chance, but they were only two or three steps away from the door now. \"Miss, I got you some food! \"Xiao happy was holding a plate and jumping up and down at the door. When she saw a man in black holding the young lady with a sword, she couldn't help but screamed, \"Ah! \"At the same time, the plate in his hand was thrown out. Suddenly there was an extra person. The assassin was stunned for a moment, and quickly adjusted, but gave Xi Yi a chance. She flashed to the assassin, hit him on the arm with the side of her hand, and knocked the sword out of his hand. Seeing the weapon fall to the ground, the assassin shook off Luo Xue and used Qinggong to fly to the other side of Xiaozhu. Xi Yi shouted to the outside: \"Catch the assassin! \"Then he quickly chased after her. \"Xiao happy, are you okay? Luo Xue, who was sitting on the ground, asked. \"Miss, Xiaoxi is okay. Miss, how are you?\" \"With that said, he helped Luo Xue stand up. \"It's okay. Has Xi Yi been outside all the time? \"Yes, Xi Yi said that he would keep an eye on the young lady, but he was worried that the young lady would be hungry, so he asked Xiao Xi to ask the kitchen to get some food.\" \"Xiao happy said truthfully, \"Miss, you look so handsome in your clothes! \"Haha, let's go out and have a look too.\" \"Luo Xue put on a coat, and Xiao Xi supported each other and walked out in the direction where Xi Yi disappeared. Not long after reaching the other side, they heard the voices of the two sides fighting each other. After a while, the palace guards arrived, and the voices became chaotic. Luo Xue and Xiao happy heard the sound and looked for it. \"The assassin is injured, he will not run too far! Luo Xue speculated. Before she could make the following judgment, she felt a round thing rolling over. \"What is this?\" \"Xiao happy also saw it. At this time, the clouds blocking the moon were blown away by the wind. With the bright moonlight, Luo Xue could see clearly that it was a person's head. The big eyes on the head were still staring at her. \"Ah! \"He screamed uncontrollably and fell to the cold ground.",
